[[SECTION]]
UID: L2-ARCH-PARTNER
TITLE: System elements - partner elements

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
External systems, services and platforms the solution integrates with but does
not own or control - payment gateways, authentication systems, cloud services,
third-party APIs.

Technical integration detail - API specifications, authentication methods, data
formats, error handling, retry strategy - belongs in the outbound technical
interface sections of the calling elements' L3 documents, not here.
<<<

